WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.564
Browser MCP: your AI assistant in your own Chrome.

00:00:03.564 --> 00:00:07.035
It inherits your logins, because it's your own Chrome.

00:00:07.885 --> 00:00:10.727
It works in the Chrome you're already signed into,

00:00:10.727 --> 00:00:14.137
so your logins and two-factor codes work as they do for you.

00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:15.387
If it meets a CAPTCHA,

00:00:15.387 --> 00:00:18.683
it tries the checkbox and asks you if the page wants more.

00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:24.819
Task one: log in, even when the code comes by email.

00:00:29.969 --> 00:00:32.778
Task two: export last month's invoices.

00:00:32.778 --> 00:00:36.235
If it needs a code from your phone, it asks you.

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:41.929
Task three: get the shipping rates behind a CAPTCHA.

00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:52.142
Task four: numbers from a dashboard into a table – no API needed.

00:00:56.219 --> 00:00:58.837
Task five: test your sign-up as a new user,

00:00:58.837 --> 00:01:00.604
and find out where it breaks.

00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:07.818
Task six: ask about numbers behind a login.

00:01:07.818 --> 00:01:10.667
You're already signed into your own Chrome.

00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:17.380
Task seven: it tells you if a form didn't take the text.

00:01:23.302 --> 00:01:26.073
Up to twenty agents while you keep working.

00:01:26.073 --> 00:01:29.810
One for research, one for testing and one for monitoring –

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.550
side by side in one Chrome.

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:37.096
It all runs on your own computer.

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:40.312
Nothing is sent to us, and you don't need an account.

00:01:45.927 --> 00:01:48.344
Browser MCP is free and open source.

00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:51.702
Add it to Chrome and connect it to the AI you use.
